# ABP Multi-Tenancy

## Multi-Tenant Entity
```csharp
public class Book : AggregateRoot<Guid>, IMultiTenant
{
    public Guid? TenantId { get; set; }
    public string Name { get; set; }
}
```

## Accessing Current Tenant
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly ICurrentTenant _currentTenant;

    public void DoSomething()
    {
        var tenantId = _currentTenant.Id;
        var tenantName = _currentTenant.Name;
    }
}
```

## Switching Tenant Context
```csharp
using (_currentTenant.Change(tenantId))
{
    // Operations run in context of specified tenant
}
```

## Automatic Filtering
- Entities implementing `IMultiTenant` are automatically filtered by `TenantId`
- Disable with `_dataFilter.Disable<IMultiTenant>()`

## Connection String Per Tenant
Configure separate databases per tenant via tenant management.
